{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-numa-reserve","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"numa-reserve-mirfa-developers-","about":"Numa Reserve is an exclusive villa development by Mirfa IBC Development, located in the green and prestigious area of Meydan. It is a collection of standalone villas with five, six, and seven bedrooms, designed with a focus on spaciousness, privacy, and exceptional build quality.The architecture of the project is inspired by nature and minimalism: clean forms, soft lines, and neutral facade tones blend harmoniously with the landscape. The interiors emphasize natural materials, open layouts, and high standards of quality. Premium finishes and modern solutions are integrated to create a truly comfortable living environment.The villas are set within a gated community featuring landscaped grounds, private gardens, walking paths, and a family-friendly atmosphere. Some houses go with a private pool or jacuzzi. The project is designed to offer a peaceful lifestyle close to nature, while remaining within easy reach of the city center.Numa Reserve is just 15 minutes from MBR City District One, 20 minutes from Downtown Dubai and DXB International Airport, 35 minutes from Palm Jumeirah, which makes it ideal for both end users and investors.","price":12000000,"title":"Numa Reserve","bitrix":{"id":1373,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"District 11","tower_name":"Numa Reserve","campaign_name":"Numa Reserve","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Mirfa Developers","project_location":null},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Numa_Reserve_by_Mirfa_at_Meydan_Luxury_Villas_in_Dubai_bca3ea4b77.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Numa_Reserve_by_Mirfa_at_Meydan_Luxury_Villas_in_Dubai_bca3ea4b77.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.127280415407,"lng":55.346165530012},"country":"dubai","images1